%% UC-22 — View study analytics
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (studyAnalyticsService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    R->>AP: Open study analytics dashboard
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/studies/:id/analytics
    par aggregate per group
        B->>M: aggregate(daily_behavior_logs) - weekly active rate
    and
        B->>M: aggregate(srhi_responses) - mean SRHI trajectory per week
    and
        B->>M: aggregate(enrollments) - dropout curve (droppedOutAt)
    end
    M-->>B: aggregation results
    B-->>AP: {weeklyActiveRate, srhiTrajectory, dropoutCurve} per group
    AP-->>R: Render charts (G1-G4 comparison)
